{"id":"666476cf8bc960fb","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid.md","title":"Linearly Ordered Residuated Monoid","display":"df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid — Linearly Ordered Residuated Monoid","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid","aliases":["93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid"],"display":"df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid — Linearly Ordered Residuated Monoid","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid — Linearly Ordered Residuated Monoid"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is a set, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\\;\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\leq\\;\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\otimes,\\Rightarrow:A^2\\to A\">\\(\\otimes,\\Rightarrow:A^2\\to A\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in A\">\\(e\\in A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}\\)</span> is the predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}monoid}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}(A,\\leq,\\otimes,\\Rightarrow,e)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\leq\\;\\subseteq A^2\\land\\otimes,\\Rightarrow:A^2\\to A\\land e\\in A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(x\\leq x)\n\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;(x\\leq y\\land y\\leq z\\to x\\leq z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\leq y\\land y\\leq x\\to x=y)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\leq y\\lor y\\leq x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;((x\\otimes y)\\otimes z=x\\otimes(y\\otimes z))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(e\\otimes x=x=x\\otimes e)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\otimes y=y\\otimes x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;\\bigl(x\\otimes y\\leq z\\leftrightarrow y\\leq x\\Rightarrow z\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}monoid}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}(A,\\leq,\\otimes,\\Rightarrow,e)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\leq\\;\\subseteq A^2\\land\\otimes,\\Rightarrow:A^2\\to A\\land e\\in A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(x\\leq x)\n\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;(x\\leq y\\land y\\leq z\\to x\\leq z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\leq y\\land y\\leq x\\to x=y)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\leq y\\lor y\\leq x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;((x\\otimes y)\\otimes z=x\\otimes(y\\otimes z))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(e\\otimes x=x=x\\otimes e)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\otimes y=y\\otimes x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;\\bigl(x\\otimes y\\leq z\\leftrightarrow y\\leq x\\Rightarrow z\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The residual is oriented by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\otimes y\\leq z\">\\(x\\otimes y\\leq z\\)</span> iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\leq x\\Rightarrow z\">\\(y\\leq x\\Rightarrow z\\)</span>; commutativity supplies the symmetric adjunction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq\\;\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\otimes,\\Rightarrow:A^2\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linearly\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}monoid}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}(A,\\leq,\\otimes,\\Rightarrow,e)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\leq\\;\\subseteq A^2\\land\\otimes,\\Rightarrow:A^2\\to A\\land e\\in A\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(x\\leq x)\n\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;(x\\leq y\\land y\\leq z\\to x\\leq z)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\leq y\\land y\\leq x\\to x=y)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\leq y\\lor y\\leq x)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;((x\\otimes y)\\otimes z=x\\otimes(y\\otimes z))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(e\\otimes x=x=x\\otimes e)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\otimes y=y\\otimes x)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;\\bigl(x\\otimes y\\leq z\\leftrightarrow y\\leq x\\Rightarrow z\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"x\\otimes y\\leq z","display":false},{"tex":"y\\leq x\\Rightarrow z","display":false}],"bytes":1446,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d1699b2d03d166c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a3b65a6dbc3cc9fd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid]]."}],"outgoing":["e30eac382dc7d1a7"]}